"t in Next.js from a shared component library with a theme per brand, served as pre-built pages from Singapore. Quick fixes happen first on today's WordPress sites.\"}]}]},{\"t\":\"nav\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"subnav\",\"aria-label\":\"Sections on this tab\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"a\",\"a\":{\"href\":\"#w1\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01250\",\"v\":\"Approach\"}]},{\"t\":\"a\",\"a\":{\"href\":\"#w1b\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01251\",\"v\":\"Why headless\"}]},{\"t\":\"a\",\"a\":{\"href\":\"#w2\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01252\",\"v\":\"Frontier sitemap\"}]},{\"t\":\"a\",\"a\":{\"href\":\"#w3\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01253\",\"v\":\"Frontier quick fixes\"}]},{\"t\":\"a\",\"a\":{\"href\":\"#w4\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01254\",\"v\":\"Group site sitemap\"}]},{\"t\":\"a\",\"a\":{\"href\":\"#w5\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01255\",\"v\":\"IMC sitemap\"}]},{\"t\":\"a\",\"a\":{\"href\":\"#w6\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01256\",\"v\":\"Key templates\"}]},{\"t\":\"a\",\"a\":{\"href\":\"#w7\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01257\",\"v\":\"Development process\"}]},{\"t\":\"a\",\"a\":{\"href\":\"#w8\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01258\",\"v\":\"Solution requirements\"}]},{\"t\":\"a\",\"a\":{\"href\":\"#w9\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01259\",\"v\":\"Acceptance\"}]}]},{\"t\":\"section\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"block\",\"id\":\"w1\",\"style\":\"padding-top:0\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"div\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"sec-title\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"span\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"n\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01260\",\"v\":\"01\"}]},{\"t\":\"h2\",\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01261\",\"v\":\"Approach \u2014 quick fixes now, then a headless rebuild on Next.js\"}]}]},{\"t\":\"p\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"take\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"b\",\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01262\",\"v\":\"Takeaway:\"}]},{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01263\",\"v\":\" the Frontier team asked whether a quick fix is enough or a bigger rebuild is needed. Our answer: fix the worst friction on today's WordPress site within four weeks, then rebuild on a headless CMS with a Next.js front end. The audit shows the slowness comes from page-builder and plugin code on every page, not from the server, so tuning WordPress only goes so far.\"}]},{\"t\":\"div\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"grid3\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"div\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"card\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"span\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"pill teal\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01264\",\"v\":\"Now\"}]},{\"t\":\"h3\",\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01265\",\"v\":\"Quick fixes on today's WordPress\"}]},{\"t\":\"p\",\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01266\",\"v\":\"Weeks 1\u20134 on the current Frontier site: clinic details and Book first, sticky mobile bar, listings, redirects, tracking clean-up. Editors keep their WordPress routine until the new site is ready.\"}]}]},{\"t\":\"div\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"card\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"span\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"pill red\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01267\",\"v\":\"Rebuild\"}]},{\"t\":\"h3\",\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01268\",\"v\":\"Headless CMS + Next.js\"}]},{\"t\":\"p\",\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01269\",\"v\":\"Content (clinics, doctors, services, articles) is stored once in a headless CMS. Each site is a Next.js application that turns that content into finished pages ahead of time and serves them from a CDN in Singapore.\"}]}]},{\"t\":\"div\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"card\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"span\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"pill violet\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01270\",\"v\":\"Share\"}]},{\"t\":\"h3\",\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01271\",\"v\":\"One component library, three brand themes\"}]},{\"t\":\"p\",\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t01272\",\"v\":\"Clinic cards, finder, doctor profiles, booking bar and Healthier SG blocks are built once as Next.js components and themed per brand, so the group looks like a family and Smile Focus or GPA can join later at low cost.\"}]}]}]},{\"t\":\"div\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"tbl-wrap\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"table\",\"k\":[{\"t\":\"thead\",\"k\":[{\"t\":\"tr\",\"k\":[{\"t\":\"th\",